  "content_id": "16136144",
  "title": "Godex – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Centralized Exchange (CEX)\nCentralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, t...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Centralized Exchange (CEX)</p><p class=\"no-margin\">Centralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, they may have trading limits and may also require your identity to meet Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> Godex is an instant cryptocurrency exchange that supports crypto swaps without registration under most conditions. Godex allows anonymous crypto swaps without registration, but enforces strict AML/KYC checks for flagged or high-risk transactions. Users in restricted jurisdictions may be blocked. Godex is a privacy-focused crypto exchange that enables users to make anonymous swaps without account creation or KYC. It supports hundreds of crypto assets and emphasizes fixed rates and security.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Email Support:</b> Users can send an email to support@godex.io to receive support.</p><h1 id=\"h_01JSFXB3MVT491B542BAM8ZZ2P\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
